oesn't have it  and then  the moments when he's vulnerable are  only private moments he doesn't show to  anyone else it's more to himself  or to someone who he feels like is  inferior to him he's like if you reveal  that i just did this i will kill you so  they're  kind of you know you just sort of play  it that way just someone with no  no no sense of humor about themselves i  really can't believe that a modoc show  exists  because i've been a fan of that for a  long time it's just i feel like now  because of how all consuming pop comic  book pop culture has become  it sort of led to this and i'm wondering  i when i think back on  on your filibuster episode of parks and  rec  in 2013 that kind of has become the like  forewarning or or go-to example of like  what was going to come in the years and  i'm wondering if you ever think back on  that or if anyone's ever pointed out to  you that's  that's just sort of like the the  prophecy of what  where we'd be in 2021 i mean that at the  time it was just me  going why aren't they yelling cut i'm  panicking i'm going to dump everything i  know out of my head  because you know i just i love that show  so much i didn't want to do a bad job  but  like maybe i was unconsciously tapped  into something that a lot of people were  tapped into but it was all  just kind of in the air and it just  landed on me for some reason  i don't know i wasn't looking to do a  prophecy i was looking for  a job yeah well i mean that's as good as  any reason to do it it's just it's just  been interesting to me i'm like wow that  was  kind of spot on and here we are there's  a modoc show and i i could not be  happier about it  uh to just sort of uh ask you about what  you're working on right now i think  are you working on ap bio right now we  just rap we wrapped on friday  uh i'm just i'm just curious what what  it's like behind the scenes  when you're on a show that's brought  back out of sh like  sheer fan reaction when it's  you get that sort 